# 统一换行符: 仓库内一律 LF, 检出时不做自动转换。
# 理由: 本仓跨 Windows / Linux / macOS / CI 五端构建, 而 CRLF 会实实在在地咬人 ——
#   · shell 脚本(tools/*.sh、docs/start_lyco.sh)带 CR 时 /bin/sh 报
#     "bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M", 在 CI 上直接红掉;
#   · pet/assets 下有中文文件名的素材, 行尾漂移会让 rust-embed 产物的 hash 变化。
* text=auto eol=lf

# ───────────────── 明确文本的扩展名 ─────────────────
*.rs      text diff=rust
*.toml    text
*.md      text diff=markdown
*.json    text
*.jsonl   text
*.yml     text
*.yaml    text
*.srt     text
*.txt     text
*.sh      text eol=lf
*.py      text diff=python
*.js      text
*.mjs     text
*.svg     text
*.gitignore text
*.gitattributes text

# ───────────────── 明确二进制(永不参与 diff / 换行转换) ─────────────────
*.png     binary
*.jpg     binary
*.jpeg    binary
*.gif     binary
*.mp4     binary
*.wav     binary
*.ogg     binary
*.mp3     binary
*.ttf     binary
*.otf     binary
*.zip     binary
*.apk     binary
*.hap     binary
*.tar.gz  binary
*.ico     binary

# Cargo.lock 需要保留行结构, 强制 LF 避免跨端 diff 噪音
Cargo.lock text eol=lf linguist-generated=false
